   "body": "/claim cloud/m4q-small-sonnet\n\nPlan:\n- `tooling/docs/check_legacy_pointers.py`: parse the `// Port of <path> (<items>) @ <sha>` headers of `App/`; an item with a range (`Symbol :a-b`, `Symbol a-b`, `lines a-b` after a symbol item) must name a symbol present in lines a-b of `git show <sha>:<path>`; everything else reported as unchecked, never a failure.\n- Python stdlib tests in `scripts/tests/` (red on the pre-#1197 AppIcon pointer, green on the corrected one), wired in the Docs consistency job with a shallow fetch of the cited shas, documented in `tooling/docs/README.md`.\n- Draft PR with `compile-check` not needed (no App change); Opus review.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
